<h2>New Device Login Detected</h2>

<p>Hello {{userName}},</p>

<p>We noticed a new login to your account from a device we don't recognize:</p>

<div class="info">
  <strong>Login Details:</strong>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Device:</strong> {{deviceInfo}}</li>
    <li><strong>IP Address:</strong> {{ipAddress}}</li>
    <li><strong>Location:</strong> {{location}}</li>
    <li><strong>Time:</strong> {{loginTime}}</li>
  </ul>
</div>

<p>If this was you, no action is needed.</p>

<div class="warning">
  <strong>Wasn't you?</strong> If you don't recognize this login, we recommend:
  <ul>
    <li>Change your password immediately</li>
    <li>Review your active sessions</li>
    <li>Enable two-factor authentication</li>
  </ul>
</div>

{{#if secureAccountUrl}}
<p style="text-align: center;">
  <a href="{{secureAccountUrl}}" class="btn">Secure My Account</a>
</p>
{{/if}}

<p>Best regards,<br>The AI Content Authenticator Team</p>
